@node Top
@top Sound of the Future

This manual documents @strong{Sound of the Future} (@code{SotF}),
a Rust audio DSP workspace covering an audio player (TUI and native
desktop), AutoEQ for speakers and headphones, RoomEQ for in-room
correction, a plugin host, a CoreAudio HAL driver, and a collection
of math/DSP crates.

Edition @value{EDITION}, @value{UPDATED}.
